POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 4: What is LangChain4J?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### Msg 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 5: What is a ReAct agent loop?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### Msg 6
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 6: What is AES-GCM-SIV?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

