### Msg 11
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 11: What is MicroProfile?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### Msg 12 — At this point compaction may trigger (threshold=5 above keep-recent=5)
# Watch logs for: [COMPACTION] triggered session=... messages_compacted=N
# Audit event: CONTEXT_COMPACTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 12: What is OpenTelemetry?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### Msg 13
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 13: What is Jaeger?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### Msg 14
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 14: What is Prometheus?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### Msg 15 — second compaction wave may trigger here
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{"goal": "Memory window test message 15: What is ScopedValue in Java 21?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### [MEM-5] Verify CONTEXT_COMPACTED in audit after window fills
# Expect: at least one CONTEXT_COMPACTED eventType row
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LONG-TERM MEMORY SEARCH (MemorySearchTool)
# Uses FTS5 to search compaction summaries across all past sessions.
# Tenant-isolated by userId — cannot access other users' memories.
# Only coordinator, researcher, architect, synthesizer have this tool.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [MEM-6] Create session to test memory_search tool
# @name memSearchSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [MEM-7] Ask coordinator to search compaction summaries for SQLite topics
# The agent will invoke MemorySearchTool with the search query
# This is useful when earlier conversations have been compacted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSearchSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Search your long-term memory for any information about SQLite and WAL mode from previous conversations.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

### [MEM-8] Researcher role also has memory_search
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSearchSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Search your memory for any past discussions about virtual threads or Podman.",
    "agentRole": "researcher",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

### [MEM-9] Coder role does NOT have memory_search — tool schema is empty
# Brahma cannot invoke MemorySearchTool regardless of prompt
# Expect: agent responds without using any tool
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSearchSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Search your long-term memory for any past discussions about Java generics.",
    "agentRole": "coder",
    "maxIterations": 2
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SOFT RESET — verifies ReAct state clears but chat memory survives
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [MEM-10] Run a goal to establish checkpoint state
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is 10 + 10?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [MEM-11] Soft reset — wipes ReAct state, keeps chat memory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "/reset",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### [MEM-12] After reset — chat history is preserved
# Agent should still recall "ArcClaw" and "Quarkus" from earlier turns (MEM-1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What was the project name I mentioned earlier in this conversation?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CLEANUP
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{pruneSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memSearchSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###
